<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 31.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 31.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali and Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi express their attachment to the Arab Maghreb Union (AMU).</p>
<p>- Gaddafi, on the third day of his visit to Tunisia, on Tuesday praised Tunisia's education policy.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Does amiante an issue in Tunisia?</p>
</text>
